  "qualifications": [
    "Verified on the accepted walk integration baseline c2a1036; newer parent-main integration and central runner/contracts union remain separate.",
    "Config::with_id and typed stored ledger values support borrowed non-Clone/non-serde data. Config::new selects JSON identity and requires Change:Serialize only at that constructor.",
    "Opaque values read through an injected/prototype ledger entry require an explicit caller projection at the existing cache boundary. Missing or failing projections remain visible errors; no reflection runtime was added.",
    "Generic opaque persistence requires a caller-owned decoder at the Serde boundary. Shared data observations preserve undefined, nonfinite and UTF-16 values before explicit JSON reload.",
    "Existing native future scheduling and UTF-8 runtime tag qualifications remain. No parser, executor, Promise/schema runtime, cache implementation or registry was added.",
    "Capability discovery retained the two inherited tsgo diagnostic warnings; declarations were emitted and all70 scoped signatures and actual public-call mappings were checked.",
    "Source TypeScript stayed frozen. No Docker, remote, GitHub, deployment or publication commands were used."
  ]
